{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47158","headline":"垓下怀古 · 栖一","name":"垓下怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缅想咸阳事可嗟，楚歌哀怨思无涯。\n八千子弟归何处，万里鸿沟属汉家。\n弓指阵前争日月，血流垓下定龙蛇。\n拔山力尽乌江水，今古悠悠空浪花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}